Downloaded, not shipped
-----------------------

These are fetched at run time, checked against pinned SHA-256 values where
the app pins them, and are not part of Cartouche's release.

  Valve Steam client packages     Steamworks SDK License / Valve terms, from
                                  Valve's content servers, listed in
                                  app/Sources/NotProtonApp/Resources/valve-packages.manifest
  Winetricks                      LGPL, from github.com/Winetricks/winetricks
  Libretro cores and core info    Per core, from buildbot.libretro.com

Community data
--------------

Data licenses are listed in docs/DATA-SCHEMA.md: AppleGamingWiki (CC BY-NC-SA
3.0), ProtonDB export (ODbL 1.0) and AreWeAntiCheatYet (MIT) are in the nightly
file. MacGamingDB publishes no data license, so Cartouche reads it live and
never redistributes it.

